# Echoing Deeps with no land card in any graveyard: its "you may" asks nothing (CR 707.2 needs a card to copy) and it enters
# untapped as itself. The Masked Meower in the graveyard is a nonland card, so it is no candidate (a Cave filter that let it
# in would ask). The refusal `! Bot1.Accept` shows no question was put; the other scenarios, with a land card there, ask.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Masked Meower
Llanowar Elves
Echoing Deeps
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x7
Llanowar Elves
Plains x7

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Masked Meower.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Masked Meower.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Discard 1 card)
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Echoing Deeps.Play
! Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Echoing Deeps; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield.Echoing Deeps.Tapped = false
